le":"史家所述谮害者","evidence":["feipin-q-7913e7af26bf2f32bae8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-7913e7af26bf2f32bae8"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-7913e7af26bf2f32bae8","order":9068},{"id":"feipin-e-1b3ac7ce11ddb58636c9","title":"潘后遣问孙弘吕后专制故事","accounts":[{"id":"feipin-a-1b3ac7ce11ddb58636c9","label":"正文","text":"潘后遣问孙弘吕后专制故事","evidence":["feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0130","role":"遣问者","evidence":["feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69"]},{"person":"zhanggu-p0009","role":"被问者","evidence":["feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69","order":9069},{"id":"feipin-e-4e6dd83bd21b726cf5b1","title":"潘后侍疾羸病遭宫人缢杀，事泄六七人死","accounts":[{"id":"feipin-a-4e6dd83bd21b726cf5b1","label":"正文","text":"潘后侍疾羸病遭宫人缢杀，事泄六七人死","evidence":["feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0130","role":"被缢杀者","evidence":["feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479","order":9070}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0130","name":"潘氏（孙权皇后）","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o162","feipin-q-4a9efd07a3b87e390250","feipin-q-7913e7af26bf2f32bae8","feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69","feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479","feipin-q-1e74a0b91c4f4573011c","feipin-q-aa6be2c8edb76cc74655","feipin-q-ccfb806c2da19a96e1e1","feipin-q-189b7f28ad030c2c172d"],"facts":[{"id":"feipin-f-a135a488dac451c99c54","text":"籍贯：会稽句章","evidence":["feipin-q-189b7f28ad030c2c172d"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o162-wuzhu-p0130","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o162"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o166-wuzhu-p0130","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o166"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-189b7f28ad030c2c172d","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-60e5f325d58f4c3c6c6c","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权潘夫人，会稽句章人也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-1e74a0b91c4f4573011c","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-90b2784ebf9809f302b9","layer":"original","quote":"权寻薨，合葬蒋陵。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-4a9efd07a3b87e390250","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-09122dabc5c0a8d85df5","layer":"original","quote":"明年，立夫人为皇后。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-7913e7af26bf2f32bae8","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-90b2784ebf9809f302b9","layer":"original","quote":"性险妒容媚，自始至卒，谮害袁夫人等甚众。﹝一﹞","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-90b2784ebf9809f302b9","layer":"original","quote":"权不豫〖4〗，夫人使问中书令孙弘吕后专制故事〖5〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-aa6be2c8edb76cc74655","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-60e5f325d58f4c3c6c6c","layer":"original","quote":"吴主权潘夫人，会稽句章人也。父为吏，坐法死〖1〗。夫人与姊，俱输织室〖2〗；权见而异之，召充后宫。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-ccfb806c2da19a96e1e1","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-60e5f325d58f4c3c6c6c","layer":"original","quote":"得幸有娠，梦有以龙头授己者，己以蔽膝受之〖3〗，遂生孙亮。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-f5a9ed0c66bef36ab479","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-90b2784ebf9809f302b9","layer":"original","quote":"侍疾疲劳，因以羸疾〖6〗；诸宫人伺其昏卧，共缢杀之，托言“中恶〖7〗”。后事泄，坐死者六七人。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o030","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-3246574a0401a9de5d60","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平三年正月，畅薨，追赠车骑将军，谥曰恭侯。子绍嗣。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-2e33035f6e5c057637af","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-aba916faf5205f1e5d7f","layer":"original","quote":"明年四月，权薨","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-6b42b9bec01a74e71091","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-5a561653680a53bb927d","layer":"original","quote":"四月，权薨，诸葛恪秉政。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-93b8ef69a1fce6728e25","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-8f3528755e98f64edf66","layer":"original","quote":"翌日，权薨","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗四年：嘉平四年（公元252）。癸卯：旧历初二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-db96ad991a403b6a010e","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o052","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-944c76689fd8a3e8fa86","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月，癸卯〖17〗，以抚军大将军司马景王为大将军。二月，立皇后张氏〖18〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o162a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年夏五月，立皇后潘氏〖1〗。大赦，改年。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o166b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b62c4eca93eda253f3b0","layer":"original","quote":"二月，大赦，改元为神凤。皇后潘氏薨。诸将吏数诣王表请福，表亡去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o162","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年夏五月，立皇后潘氏〖1〗。大赦，改年。初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o166","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b62c4eca93eda253f3b0","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖12〗，立故太子和为南阳王，居长沙〖13〗；子奋为齐王，居武昌；子休为琅邪王〖14〗，居虎林〖15〗。二月，大赦，改元为神凤。皇后潘氏薨。诸将吏数诣王表请福，表亡去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":302,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
